This is a self-hosted [https://github.com/Rokurolize/wikijump Wikijump] instance. Its operator has not published terms beyond what this page states.

+ Content

* The content of each wiki is licensed as stated in the footer of its pages.
* The SCP Wiki and SCP-JP sites here are read-only mirrors of [https://scp-wiki.wikidot.com scp-wiki.wikidot.com] and [https://scp-jp.wikidot.com scp-jp.wikidot.com]. Their pages are copies of content published there under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0, and their authors are credited on the source pages. Edit those pages on the source wikis.

+ Software

This instance runs Wikijump, which is distributed under the [https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.html GNU Affero General Public License v3]. That license gives no warranty.

